      "rationale": "חית השדה singular ya kwaria kĩngĩgia (ng'ombe\/nduriri imwe) no KJV 'a beast' yaheana rimwe; JPS 'beasts' atĩrĩ na maingĩ — gĩcenji gĩkũhĩ nĩ mũthemba wa gũcooka."
