    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "kĩgũcũ na mũcathamũ",
      "rationale": "Uuge wa keero ũrĩa Yehoaci ahoragia Amaciyahu ta kĩgũcũ kĩng'etwo na mũcathamũ — fable ya Kĩhibirania, kũgerwo nĩ gĩthimo kĩa ũthamaki."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "ũhoro ũyũ",
      "rationale": "לאמר irutagwo rora-rora ĩigĩrũa na 'kũuga' gĩa kĩambĩrĩria; kĩongerwo naguo gũcunjĩ-inĩ kĩa mbere gĩa kũhoreria kĩgunĩ kĩa ũhoro."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na Yehoaci mũthamaki wa Yiceraeri atumĩra Amaciyahu mũthamaki wa Yehuda ũhoro ũyũ: Kĩgũcũ gĩarĩirie Lebanoni kĩatumĩra kĩ mũcathamũ wa Lebanoni, kĩũga atĩrĩ: He ⟨את⟩ mũritũ wakwa nĩmũka wa mũrũ wakwa; na nyamu cia mũgũnda iria iciĩ Lebanoni ciacokire itanyanyũithia ⟨את⟩ kĩgũcũ kĩu.",
